(406076, 35916, 9241, '<td valign="top">I like the background alot. I think the pencil is shot a little too close, I would like to see more of it. Also perhaps at somewhat of an angle instead of straight across.</td>', 'I like the background alot. I think the pencil is shot a little too close, I would like to see more of it. Also perhaps at somewhat of an angle instead of straight across.', '2003-09-01 11:05:32.000000', NULL, 1),
