(406196, 35658, 7969, '<td valign="top">This is a very funny shot, I really like it, and your dog gets a point for so patiently enduring the costume, my dog would never sit still for this kind of thing.   Thanks for the laugh.</td>', 'This is a very funny shot, I really like it, and your dog gets a point for so patiently enduring the costume, my dog would never sit still for this kind of thing.   Thanks for the laugh.', '2003-09-01 12:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
