(406201, 35788, 7969, '<td valign="top">I really like this kind of effect I wish I could learn how to do it for myself.  I often feel b&amp;w shots need a splash of color, works very well for your choice of subjects too.  Technically I suppose would of been bit better if could of blurred the house. ( though no idea how could do that and keep swings in focus). Well done.</td>', 'I really like this kind of effect I wish I could learn how to do it for myself.  I often feel b&w shots need a splash of color, works very well for your choice of subjects too.  Technically I suppose would of been bit better if could of blurred the house. ( though no idea how could do that and keep swings in focus). Well done.', '2003-09-01 12:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(406202, 35743, 10414, '<td valign="top">Perfect....yet simple!!   10</td>', 'Perfect....yet simple!!   10', '2003-09-01 12:50:18.000000', NULL, 1),
