(406254, 35922, 7969, '<td valign="top">Boy do i know how mom feels!  lol</td>', 'Boy do i know how mom feels!  lol', '2003-09-01 13:13:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(406255, 35756, 3102, '<td valign="top">I''ve been staring at this shot for minutes, and I can''t even think of a comment!  I''m considering hanging this in my daughter''s room, and I''ll remind her every day that if she ever brings home anyone who looks like these people, she''s in BIG trouble!!  Quite a capture here, I must say!</td>', 'I''ve been staring at this shot for minutes, and I can''t even think of a comment!  I''m considering hanging this in my daughter''s room, and I''ll remind her every day that if she ever brings home anyone who looks like these people, she''s in BIG trouble!!  Quite a capture here, I must say!', '2003-09-01 13:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(406256, 35928, 7969, '<td valign="top">Would like to see the top part cropped to give more of focus to subject.  Curtains bit distracting.</td>', 'Would like to see the top part cropped to give more of focus to subject.  Curtains bit distracting.', '2003-09-01 13:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(406257, 35777, 3102, '<td valign="top">Nice looking teacher!  They never seemed to look like that when I was in school :)<br/> <br/>I like the use of B&amp;W here, and how the shot tells a nice story.  My only minor gripe is that I may have moved the teacher to the right window because the gutters of the building in the background seems to blend into her hair a bit too much. - 8</td>', 'Nice looking teacher!  They never seemed to look like that when I was in school :) I like the use of B&W here, and how the shot tells a nice story.  My only minor gripe is that I may have moved the teacher to the right window because the gutters of the building in the background seems to blend into her hair a bit too much. - 8', '2003-09-01 13:15:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(406258, 35869, 7969, '<td valign="top">Nice tones.Funny shot.</td>', 'Nice tones.Funny shot.', '2003-09-01 13:15:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(406260, 35617, 7969, '<td valign="top">Hmm, not the normal back to school thought. Or at least the first one, well done shot and creative.</td>', 'Hmm, not the normal back to school thought. Or at least the first one, well done shot and creative.', '2003-09-01 13:16:36.000000', NULL, 1),
