(406299, 35777, 10643, '<td valign="top">I like this but think it would be better with a slightly different angle. The reflection of her face in the glass is very nice but its impact is lost by the sharp line of the roof outside, so if that were in a different spot in the window (or if she were) the effect would be stronger.</td>', 'I like this but think it would be better with a slightly different angle. The reflection of her face in the glass is very nice but its impact is lost by the sharp line of the roof outside, so if that were in a different spot in the window (or if she were) the effect would be stronger.', '2003-09-01 13:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(406300, 35916, 4210, '<td valign="top">Good use of dof!</td>', 'Good use of dof!', '2003-09-01 13:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(406301, 35809, 7969, '<td valign="top">I guess the window provides a light source, though I find the blinds distracting. just a thought.</td>', 'I guess the window provides a light source, though I find the blinds distracting. just a thought.', '2003-09-01 13:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(406303, 35743, 10643, '<td valign="top">One of the best books ever, required reading or not! I hope this copy is brand new and will be beat up and creased soon.</td>', 'One of the best books ever, required reading or not! I hope this copy is brand new and will be beat up and creased soon.', '2003-09-01 13:46:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(406304, 35759, 7969, '<td valign="top">I like the way you used the sort of monotone color scheme to bring together a lot of objects, it works well to solidify your image as a whole.</td>', 'I like the way you used the sort of monotone color scheme to bring together a lot of objects, it works well to solidify your image as a whole.', '2003-09-01 13:48:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(406305, 35646, 4210, '<td valign="top">Good colour. I thought it might look a little pixelated, but I decided that it''s only the reflectivey stuff on the stop sign and some blue sun things.</td>', 'Good colour. I thought it might look a little pixelated, but I decided that it''s only the reflectivey stuff on the stop sign and some blue sun things.', '2003-09-01 13:48:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(406307, 35658, 10643, '<td valign="top">Funny! Congratulations on having such a patient dog! Hope he got treats for this indignity :)</td>', 'Funny! Congratulations on having such a patient dog! Hope he got treats for this indignity :)', '2003-09-01 13:49:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(406309, 35651, 7969, '<td valign="top">I think would of worked better had you blurred the background via depth of field.  Especially important when the backgrounds are as unattractive as these, i.e. dirt field, cars.</td>', 'I think would of worked better had you blurred the background via depth of field.  Especially important when the backgrounds are as unattractive as these, i.e. dirt field, cars.', '2003-09-01 13:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(406310, 35944, 4210, '<td valign="top">I think that the mirror makes this photo interesting, whereas otherwise it would just be boring. But the sky is also blown out, and the colours seem like you added too much brightness.</td>', 'I think that the mirror makes this photo interesting, whereas otherwise it would just be boring. But the sky is also blown out, and the colours seem like you added too much brightness.', '2003-09-01 13:50:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(406311, 35854, 7969, '<td valign="top">Not a bad image technically, but a little lacking in ''wow''</td>', 'Not a bad image technically, but a little lacking in ''wow''', '2003-09-01 13:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(406312, 35858, 4210, '<td valign="top">Now, this photo is not likely to do very well in the challenge. But you know what? I like it alot anyways. How did you get this effect?</td>', 'Now, this photo is not likely to do very well in the challenge. But you know what? I like it alot anyways. How did you get this effect?', '2003-09-01 13:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
