(406345, 35658, 10402, '<td valign="top">Very creative; I love it. So do both of my kids, who are urging me to give it a 10! I''m inclined to do so, even if I wish it wasn''t so tightly cropped. A little sharpening would help too. But I still like it.</td>', 'Very creative; I love it. So do both of my kids, who are urging me to give it a 10! I''m inclined to do so, even if I wish it wasn''t so tightly cropped. A little sharpening would help too. But I still like it.', '2003-09-01 14:06:14.000000', NULL, 1),
