(406363, 35861, 7969, '<td valign="top">Does have creative aspect to it, wish for a bit more of  bikes and not quite so dark, just a thought.</td>', 'Does have creative aspect to it, wish for a bit more of  bikes and not quite so dark, just a thought.', '2003-09-01 14:15:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(406365, 35950, 7969, '<td valign="top">Yup lots of debt getting an education these days.</td>', 'Yup lots of debt getting an education these days.', '2003-09-01 14:16:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(406368, 35865, 8911, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition of this shot. There are a lot of compression artifacts on the diagonal lines, though - most noticeable on the leftmost bus (top of door, top of windows, line below the text and lights), but also definitely visible on some of the other buses.<br/> <br/>This is such a classic school-related shot, though.</td>', 'I really like the composition of this shot. There are a lot of compression artifacts on the diagonal lines, though - most noticeable on the leftmost bus (top of door, top of windows, line below the text and lights), but also definitely visible on some of the other buses. This is such a classic school-related shot, though.', '2003-09-01 14:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(406369, 35662, 7969, '<td valign="top">Well, it is just lacking in interest, sorry kind of harsh comment, but i think it is my responsibility to explain lower scores and I am trying to comment on all the shots. The title does fit image, I think a black background may have helped add some contrast.</td>', 'Well, it is just lacking in interest, sorry kind of harsh comment, but i think it is my responsibility to explain lower scores and I am trying to comment on all the shots. The title does fit image, I think a black background may have helped add some contrast.', '2003-09-01 14:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
