(406377, 35692, 7969, '<td valign="top">Sharp image.  (pun intended : ) )</td>', 'Sharp image.  (pun intended : ) )', '2003-09-01 14:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(406379, 35633, 8911, '<td valign="top">I like the inclusion of the tools here, and the different shapes/colors/lines from the various objects. I do wish the page of the open book on th eleft weren''t quite so washed out, though, and that the protractor was a bit crisper (the bright blue draws my eyes to it, as if it were a main subject, but it''s not as crisp as the books).</td>', 'I like the inclusion of the tools here, and the different shapes/colors/lines from the various objects. I do wish the page of the open book on th eleft weren''t quite so washed out, though, and that the protractor was a bit crisper (the bright blue draws my eyes to it, as if it were a main subject, but it''s not as crisp as the books).', '2003-09-01 14:27:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(406383, 35849, 8911, '<td valign="top">Thank you for a good chuckle, and memories of days that felt like that. I think this would be stronger if the books were in crisper focus (seems like the floor has sharper lines than the books do), but other than that, I liked it. At first I was a bit started by the choice of black and white, but I imagine the colors from everything would be a bit overwhelming if they were all present.</td>', 'Thank you for a good chuckle, and memories of days that felt like that. I think this would be stronger if the books were in crisper focus (seems like the floor has sharper lines than the books do), but other than that, I liked it. At first I was a bit started by the choice of black and white, but I imagine the colors from everything would be a bit overwhelming if they were all present.', '2003-09-01 14:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(406398, 35702, 8911, '<td valign="top">Very back-to-school, though not as crowded as it will likely be soon. That''s an interesting sign as far as the bank sponsoring it. The sign''s not as crisp as it could be, though, and the washed-out brilliance of the sky is a bit distracting.</td>', 'Very back-to-school, though not as crowded as it will likely be soon. That''s an interesting sign as far as the bank sponsoring it. The sign''s not as crisp as it could be, though, and the washed-out brilliance of the sky is a bit distracting.', '2003-09-01 14:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(406403, 35916, 8911, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you already know this, but I''ll say it anyway - the sharp focus on the pencil is AMAZING.</td>', 'I''m sure you already know this, but I''ll say it anyway - the sharp focus on the pencil is AMAZING.', '2003-09-01 14:59:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(406413, 35904, 6624, '<td valign="top">this is an interesting response to the challenge and nicely balanced.</td>', 'this is an interesting response to the challenge and nicely balanced.', '2003-09-01 15:24:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(406416, 35880, 6624, '<td valign="top">this one yanks at my heartstrings...how they love to meet the bus.</td>', 'this one yanks at my heartstrings...how they love to meet the bus.', '2003-09-01 15:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(406418, 35805, 6624, '<td valign="top">vivid - certainly a new one, hope you post it again in a month or two</td>', 'vivid - certainly a new one, hope you post it again in a month or two', '2003-09-01 15:25:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(406434, 35929, 8911, '<td valign="top">I like this - especially with the double-meaning of the title. Basic math, but also basic (classic) images of school. Lovely composition, good rich colors - this is a great image to convey a sense of school and back-to-school.</td>', 'I like this - especially with the double-meaning of the title. Basic math, but also basic (classic) images of school. Lovely composition, good rich colors - this is a great image to convey a sense of school and back-to-school.', '2003-09-01 15:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(406436, 35758, 8911, '<td valign="top">This was good for a laugh - and is a really neat photo as well as being funny. School does tend to go through pencils, doesn''t it?<br/> <br/>I like the way you''ve completely filled the frame with the pencils (hope you have a use for that many, now!) and the very sharp focus. The lighting is nice as well, unobtrusive unless you''re studying it, no glare, nice direction in terms of creating shadows but not making them too deep.</td>', 'This was good for a laugh - and is a really neat photo as well as being funny. School does tend to go through pencils, doesn''t it? I like the way you''ve completely filled the frame with the pencils (hope you have a use for that many, now!) and the very sharp focus. The lighting is nice as well, unobtrusive unless you''re studying it, no glare, nice direction in terms of creating shadows but not making them too deep.', '2003-09-01 15:48:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(406437, 35858, 8911, '<td valign="top">Those are really cool and fun erasers, and I like the idea of putting them in a circle. That said, I think you''ve been betrayed by your image quality (and possibly your lighting as well, if you were trying to compensate for it being dark). This file is 1/3 the size it can be, and the image quality is very poor, with the transitions between colors harsh and colors blotched together.</td>', 'Those are really cool and fun erasers, and I like the idea of putting them in a circle. That said, I think you''ve been betrayed by your image quality (and possibly your lighting as well, if you were trying to compensate for it being dark). This file is 1/3 the size it can be, and the image quality is very poor, with the transitions between colors harsh and colors blotched together.', '2003-09-01 15:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(406440, 35933, 8911, '<td valign="top">This is a neat concept, but the photo is a bit dark (even the paper shows as dim). Maybe brighten it up a little (so the whites were white and not yellow), and slide the stack slightly so the mechanical pencils package stuck out a bit more (stair-stepping), which would make it easier to view and also let it get a bit more light.</td>', 'This is a neat concept, but the photo is a bit dark (even the paper shows as dim). Maybe brighten it up a little (so the whites were white and not yellow), and slide the stack slightly so the mechanical pencils package stuck out a bit more (stair-stepping), which would make it easier to view and also let it get a bit more light.', '2003-09-01 15:55:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(406441, 35944, 8911, '<td valign="top">Definitely a back to school sort of topic (and that looks like a fairly pretty place, as far as school bus parking lots go). The mirror I find distracting, presentting blurry busses in the foreground against crisply focussed ones in the background - I think this might have been stronger without it. The sky''s awfully bright/washed out, but I don''t see how that could be countered without darkening the buses too much.</td>', 'Definitely a back to school sort of topic (and that looks like a fairly pretty place, as far as school bus parking lots go). The mirror I find distracting, presentting blurry busses in the foreground against crisply focussed ones in the background - I think this might have been stronger without it. The sky''s awfully bright/washed out, but I don''t see how that could be countered without darkening the buses too much.', '2003-09-01 15:56:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(406442, 35750, 8911, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely scene, and the picture''s quite nice, though the low light definitely shows in the blurring of the diver. There is a jaggy look about the hills that may be compression artifact, but the colors are gorgeous.</td>', 'This is a lovely scene, and the picture''s quite nice, though the low light definitely shows in the blurring of the diver. There is a jaggy look about the hills that may be compression artifact, but the colors are gorgeous.', '2003-09-01 15:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(406445, 35646, 8911, '<td valign="top">This is a great angle on a bus. I''m not so sure it''s a great angle for the camera, though - notice the odd patterns on the stop sign especially, and to a lesser degree the artifacts on the silver window-pieces. That may be because the image quality is lower than it has to be (under 100 k, when it could go to 150) or may be a limitation of the camera; I don''t know. The sky against the bus is a nice effect, though, the moreso because it isn''t blindingly washed out and yet the bus is not too dark against it.</td>', 'This is a great angle on a bus. I''m not so sure it''s a great angle for the camera, though - notice the odd patterns on the stop sign especially, and to a lesser degree the artifacts on the silver window-pieces. That may be because the image quality is lower than it has to be (under 100 k, when it could go to 150) or may be a limitation of the camera; I don''t know. The sky against the bus is a nice effect, though, the moreso because it isn''t blindingly washed out and yet the bus is not too dark against it.', '2003-09-01 15:59:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(406446, 35730, 6624, '<td valign="top">I bet they loved doing this one...fun response</td>', 'I bet they loved doing this one...fun response', '2003-09-01 16:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(406447, 35928, 8911, '<td valign="top">Hee. A classic mood for this one. Nice crisp focus. I think I would have either lit the background or cropped the image closer, though. It''s hard to tell where the child''s head leaves off and the background begins, because it''s so dark, and the slightly-lighter impressions of curtain and wall in the upper right are distracting.</td>', 'Hee. A classic mood for this one. Nice crisp focus. I think I would have either lit the background or cropped the image closer, though. It''s hard to tell where the child''s head leaves off and the background begins, because it''s so dark, and the slightly-lighter impressions of curtain and wall in the upper right are distracting.', '2003-09-01 16:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(406449, 35878, 8911, '<td valign="top">Study session! The composition and mood of this photo are great. That said, I think your lighting has done you a huge disservice. The light behind the girl''s head has dimmed her face and the whole scene somewhat, and brings out a piece of the background to leave us wondering, when I think it might have been better left dark, and nothing to distract us from the studying. At the same time, the foreground light, while it brings out the faces of the subjects well enough, is blindingly bright itself and has glared out all or most details of the book or notebook in front of the boy, and also of his nearer sleeve - you can even only barely see the crease at the elbow.<br/> <br/>I think I''d have tried turning off the background light, and moving the foreground light out of the shot and/or finding a softer foreground light.</td>', 'Study session! The composition and mood of this photo are great. That said, I think your lighting has done you a huge disservice. The light behind the girl''s head has dimmed her face and the whole scene somewhat, and brings out a piece of the background to leave us wondering, when I think it might have been better left dark, and nothing to distract us from the studying. At the same time, the foreground light, while it brings out the faces of the subjects well enough, is blindingly bright itself and has glared out all or most details of the book or notebook in front of the boy, and also of his nearer sleeve - you can even only barely see the crease at the elbow. I think I''d have tried turning off the background light, and moving the foreground light out of the shot and/or finding a softer foreground light.', '2003-09-01 16:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(406451, 35664, 8911, '<td valign="top">There''s a back-to-school sign if I ever saw one. I think you may have captured too much of the surroundings, though - all the road and stuff along it in the left side of the photo is, as far as I can tell, irrelevant to the topic of the photo, but it''s very distracting and draws the eye away from the sign, even as bold as the sign is. I don''t know if it would have been possible to get the shot at an angle that showed more of the school grounds and still showed the sign clearly; if not, cropping out the "road noise" would have tightened the shot up a bit.</td>', 'There''s a back-to-school sign if I ever saw one. I think you may have captured too much of the surroundings, though - all the road and stuff along it in the left side of the photo is, as far as I can tell, irrelevant to the topic of the photo, but it''s very distracting and draws the eye away from the sign, even as bold as the sign is. I don''t know if it would have been possible to get the shot at an angle that showed more of the school grounds and still showed the sign clearly; if not, cropping out the "road noise" would have tightened the shot up a bit.', '2003-09-01 16:06:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(406454, 35617, 8911, '<td valign="top">Okay, first, this is a seriously unnerving shot. *grins* I like the dramatic blue lighting - and the crisp clarity of the needle and stream of liquid. Compositionally this is very strong - showing just what you need to, just how you need to, to make the point.</td>', 'Okay, first, this is a seriously unnerving shot. *grins* I like the dramatic blue lighting - and the crisp clarity of the needle and stream of liquid. Compositionally this is very strong - showing just what you need to, just how you need to, to make the point.', '2003-09-01 16:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(406455, 35814, 8911, '<td valign="top">Classic images for school...the backlighting is a little distracting here, washing out the edges of the apple and pencil - perhaps a background to keep the glare down might have helped, or changing the angle of the shots. Really nice composition.</td>', 'Classic images for school...the backlighting is a little distracting here, washing out the edges of the apple and pencil - perhaps a background to keep the glare down might have helped, or changing the angle of the shots. Really nice composition.', '2003-09-01 16:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(406457, 35810, 8911, '<td valign="top">AUGH! Okay, bad puns aside, this is an absolutely gorgeous shot. Nice location, nice angle and composition - like the hint of modern buildings in the background, and the way the older ones dominate the scene. The people in this image really help it feel like this is a living place, a place that may soon be very busy and even now has some activity.</td>', 'AUGH! Okay, bad puns aside, this is an absolutely gorgeous shot. Nice location, nice angle and composition - like the hint of modern buildings in the background, and the way the older ones dominate the scene. The people in this image really help it feel like this is a living place, a place that may soon be very busy and even now has some activity.', '2003-09-01 16:11:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(406458, 35902, 8911, '<td valign="top">This is classic, very crisp and clear, though when I was that age, that sort of sweet look (if it appeared at all) would have lasted only until the camera and adult took their attention elsewhere. :)</td>', 'This is classic, very crisp and clear, though when I was that age, that sort of sweet look (if it appeared at all) would have lasted only until the camera and adult took their attention elsewhere. :)', '2003-09-01 16:12:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(406460, 35692, 8911, '<td valign="top">Everyone''s favorite past-time, I''m sure...this is a very school-feeling picture, and I love the ruler. The mix of colors and shapes from all the elements works really nicely here.</td>', 'Everyone''s favorite past-time, I''m sure...this is a very school-feeling picture, and I love the ruler. The mix of colors and shapes from all the elements works really nicely here.', '2003-09-01 16:13:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(406461, 35743, 8911, '<td valign="top">Black-and-white is really effective on this one, making for a crisp/stark look that really makes it stand out. Everything''s ready for the homework to start here...except maybe the student, of course. :)</td>', 'Black-and-white is really effective on this one, making for a crisp/stark look that really makes it stand out. Everything''s ready for the homework to start here...except maybe the student, of course. :)', '2003-09-01 16:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(406463, 35788, 8911, '<td valign="top">I really like the desaturation on this one, the way it makes the playground equipment stand out so boldly. The sky is a fair bit glaring, though - if I scroll so that it''s cut off at the top of the left-hand tree, I like the feel of the image much more, and don''t find my eyes drawn to the sky nearly as much, if at all.</td>', 'I really like the desaturation on this one, the way it makes the playground equipment stand out so boldly. The sky is a fair bit glaring, though - if I scroll so that it''s cut off at the top of the left-hand tree, I like the feel of the image much more, and don''t find my eyes drawn to the sky nearly as much, if at all.', '2003-09-01 16:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(406464, 35949, 8911, '<td valign="top">This is very clear and crisp for a night shot - I''m impressed, especially that the trees are so visible in silhouette against such a dark sky. The building seems to lean a bit, though, compared to the left-hand side of the photo.</td>', 'This is very clear and crisp for a night shot - I''m impressed, especially that the trees are so visible in silhouette against such a dark sky. The building seems to lean a bit, though, compared to the left-hand side of the photo.', '2003-09-01 16:17:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(406465, 35603, 8911, '<td valign="top">This is a really disturbing photo. It works - indeed, that it is so disturbing says much about how good an image it is. It''s just a bit soft, which I think makes it stronger in this case, as an incongruity with the harsh subject matter.</td>', 'This is a really disturbing photo. It works - indeed, that it is so disturbing says much about how good an image it is. It''s just a bit soft, which I think makes it stronger in this case, as an incongruity with the harsh subject matter.', '2003-09-01 16:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(406474, 35777, 10510, '<td valign="top">Great picture Aubrey.  I like the way you caught her reflection in the window too.</td>', 'Great picture Aubrey.  I like the way you caught her reflection in the window too.', '2003-09-01 16:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(406527, 35617, 10402, '<td valign="top">Great idea for the challenge. I like the color and lighting here.</td>', 'Great idea for the challenge. I like the color and lighting here.', '2003-09-01 17:41:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(406547, 35902, 10402, '<td valign="top">I like your composition. And the red bows.</td>', 'I like your composition. And the red bows.', '2003-09-01 18:05:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(406573, 35756, 7778, '<td valign="top">Refreshing image capturing more than what one expect, given the (topical) invitation to produce a clichee. Technically, I consider the photo a little dark and have some reservation about the large DOF, icluding so much of the background. I would, perhaps, wish for a slighter sharper focus of the faces. The sign the is hilariously effective here, given the trend. <br/> <br/>All in all, a worthwhile piece of photojournalism with a strongly contemporary subject.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Refreshing image capturing more than what one expect, given the (topical) invitation to produce a clichee. Technically, I consider the photo a little dark and have some reservation about the large DOF, icluding so much of the background. I would, perhaps, wish for a slighter sharper focus of the faces. The sign the is hilariously effective here, given the trend.  All in all, a worthwhile piece of photojournalism with a strongly contemporary subject. ', '2003-09-01 18:51:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(406575, 35944, 10260, '<td valign="top">I like the way you used the mirror to catch some of the busses.  Clever idea.</td>', 'I like the way you used the mirror to catch some of the busses.  Clever idea.', '2003-09-01 18:57:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(406576, 35890, 10260, '<td valign="top">It''s hard to get past those sweet faces to critique the photo.  From the looks of those eyes, I''d guess their sisters. :)  Wonderful colors, clarity outstanding.</td>', 'It''s hard to get past those sweet faces to critique the photo.  From the looks of those eyes, I''d guess their sisters. :)  Wonderful colors, clarity outstanding.', '2003-09-01 18:59:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(406577, 35658, 10260, '<td valign="top">This is hilarious.    Great shot.....huggable subject too.</td>', 'This is hilarious.    Great shot.....huggable subject too.', '2003-09-01 19:02:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(406578, 35949, 10218, '<td valign="top">I love that building.  I spent a youth conference at USU campus once.  Good memories.<br/> <br/>Is this the work of dsidwell or family? ;)</td>', 'I love that building.  I spent a youth conference at USU campus once.  Good memories. Is this the work of dsidwell or family? ;)', '2003-09-01 19:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(406579, 35664, 9452, '<td valign="top">Fair warnning</td>', 'Fair warnning', '2003-09-01 19:13:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(406580, 35949, 6504, '<td valign="top">I guess this is A&amp;M.  You have captured this beautifully.</td>', 'I guess this is A&M.  You have captured this beautifully.', '2003-09-01 19:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(406581, 35916, 6504, '<td valign="top">Good clear shot.  Looks like the pencil went through a grinder, tho.  Still an excellent selection for the challenge.  (Looking at it I can almost smell the pencil)</td>', 'Good clear shot.  Looks like the pencil went through a grinder, tho.  Still an excellent selection for the challenge.  (Looking at it I can almost smell the pencil)', '2003-09-01 19:19:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(406582, 35922, 9452, '<td valign="top">LOL, 10</td>', 'LOL, 10', '2003-09-01 19:21:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(406583, 35666, 6504, '<td valign="top">This is a good picture.  I especially like the little girl''s dress for the background.</td>', 'This is a good picture.  I especially like the little girl''s dress for the background.', '2003-09-01 19:21:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(406584, 35886, 6504, '<td valign="top">Someone''s about to get in trouble, eh?   Nice clean picture, very good clarity and colors.</td>', 'Someone''s about to get in trouble, eh?   Nice clean picture, very good clarity and colors.', '2003-09-01 19:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(406585, 35929, 6504, '<td valign="top">I would like this picture better with a little more light.</td>', 'I would like this picture better with a little more light.', '2003-09-01 19:22:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(406586, 35809, 6504, '<td valign="top">I can just picture the pretty girl that goes with these things.  Very good picture, nice lighting, clarity.</td>', 'I can just picture the pretty girl that goes with these things.  Very good picture, nice lighting, clarity.', '2003-09-01 19:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(406587, 35617, 6504, '<td valign="top">Scary!   I think I would rather have seen this without all the blue.</td>', 'Scary!   I think I would rather have seen this without all the blue.', '2003-09-01 19:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(406588, 35944, 6504, '<td valign="top">I would like to suggest that this picture would be improved without the mirror. While the school buses alone are not interesting, you have the beautiful backdrop of the mountains, which are obscured by the mirror.  (imho)</td>', 'I would like to suggest that this picture would be improved without the mirror. While the school buses alone are not interesting, you have the beautiful backdrop of the mountains, which are obscured by the mirror.  (imho)', '2003-09-01 19:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(406589, 35854, 6504, '<td valign="top">My hope would be that nobody sees school as hell.  As for the picture, nice clear shot, good lighting, and the relflection of the clouds is a nice touch.</td>', 'My hope would be that nobody sees school as hell.  As for the picture, nice clear shot, good lighting, and the relflection of the clouds is a nice touch.', '2003-09-01 19:28:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(406590, 35603, 6504, '<td valign="top">My heart breaks to see a gun in a back to school challenge.</td>', 'My heart breaks to see a gun in a back to school challenge.', '2003-09-01 19:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(406611, 35756, 5585, '<td valign="top">Kids...lol.. who da thought ? good capture of today...sometimes wonder if it is a good capture....if you know what I mean... BUT... ok....interesting bit...Photojournalism...</td>', 'Kids...lol.. who da thought ? good capture of today...sometimes wonder if it is a good capture....if you know what I mean... BUT... ok....interesting bit...Photojournalism...', '2003-09-01 20:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(406615, 35651, 5585, '<td valign="top">Meet the Challenge ? Yes....crop could of been better...too much sharpening.. (IMHO)...</td>', 'Meet the Challenge ? Yes....crop could of been better...too much sharpening.. (IMHO)...', '2003-09-01 20:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(406618, 35751, 5585, '<td valign="top">Composition is lacking...needs a sharper focus.. or a tighter crop...but you knew that..</td>', 'Composition is lacking...needs a sharper focus.. or a tighter crop...but you knew that..', '2003-09-01 20:28:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(406621, 35666, 5585, '<td valign="top">Shooting at a higher resolution...and cropping... at interesting points...leading the viewer to all Ideas conveyed... might work here..</td>', 'Shooting at a higher resolution...and cropping... at interesting points...leading the viewer to all Ideas conveyed... might work here..', '2003-09-01 20:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(406623, 35904, 5585, '<td valign="top">Cafeteria.... BIG School...lol....getting ready...</td>', 'Cafeteria.... BIG School...lol....getting ready...', '2003-09-01 20:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(406624, 35849, 5585, '<td valign="top">Funny stuff....</td>', 'Funny stuff....', '2003-09-01 20:35:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(406628, 35759, 5585, '<td valign="top">I wish this was sharper.... nice Idea....</td>', 'I wish this was sharper.... nice Idea....', '2003-09-01 20:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(406630, 35730, 5585, '<td valign="top">Cute.. lol.. what''s a Kid to do ?... I think he should just go....</td>', 'Cute.. lol.. what''s a Kid to do ?... I think he should just go....', '2003-09-01 20:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(406633, 35814, 5585, '<td valign="top">Apple for the teacher.... good choice...</td>', 'Apple for the teacher.... good choice...', '2003-09-01 20:45:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(406636, 35603, 5585, '<td valign="top">Interesting Choice here...topical... time to face the reality ....guns don''t sovle problems... we know that...as for the photo...work on the resizing..Hollow Points?? sheesh...to me ..this has struck a Chord...when I went to school... we fought with fists...... 8-/</td>', 'Interesting Choice here...topical... time to face the reality ....guns don''t sovle problems... we know that...as for the photo...work on the resizing..Hollow Points?? sheesh...to me ..this has struck a Chord...when I went to school... we fought with fists...... 8-/', '2003-09-01 20:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(406644, 35758, 6008, '<td valign="top">This would have been good for repetition also. It has quite a mesmerising pattern, although that one pencil in the middle seems to want to be a rebel and throw the left side off. The image is nicely sharp (no pun intended) and meets the challenge. Good shot!</td>', 'This would have been good for repetition also. It has quite a mesmerising pattern, although that one pencil in the middle seems to want to be a rebel and throw the left side off. The image is nicely sharp (no pun intended) and meets the challenge. Good shot!', '2003-09-01 21:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(406648, 35906, 6008, '<td valign="top">The choice of black and white seems to put a bit of a mood on the image, which I suppose could appropriately compliment the concentrated look on his face also. The wall background gives a nice contrast to the rest of the image. Unfortunately there isnt much detail on his face and so the shot relies a lot on his body language. It''s a good shot, but I think I may have preferred it had it had some more drama, whether that be lighting, pose, or position in the frame.</td>', 'The choice of black and white seems to put a bit of a mood on the image, which I suppose could appropriately compliment the concentrated look on his face also. The wall background gives a nice contrast to the rest of the image. Unfortunately there isnt much detail on his face and so the shot relies a lot on his body language. It''s a good shot, but I think I may have preferred it had it had some more drama, whether that be lighting, pose, or position in the frame.', '2003-09-01 21:18:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(406651, 35777, 6008, '<td valign="top">An interesting take on the challenge, seeing it from the teacher''s angle instead of the student. At first I wasnt too sure about the reflection in the window but it slowly grew on me. There does seem to be a white halo near the ledge and just under her chin that is a little distracting as my eyes are actually drawn to the reflection the most. The choice of black and white is good to set the broody mood of anticipation, or at least it comes across to me that she is not looking forward to being back at school from the lighting, pose, and choice of b&amp;w.  Overall it''s a good image, I like it.</td>', 'An interesting take on the challenge, seeing it from the teacher''s angle instead of the student. At first I wasnt too sure about the reflection in the window but it slowly grew on me. There does seem to be a white halo near the ledge and just under her chin that is a little distracting as my eyes are actually drawn to the reflection the most. The choice of black and white is good to set the broody mood of anticipation, or at least it comes across to me that she is not looking forward to being back at school from the lighting, pose, and choice of b&w.  Overall it''s a good image, I like it.', '2003-09-01 21:25:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(406655, 35916, 6008, '<td valign="top">The DOF on this is really good, and the sharpness of the pencil is equally as good. At first I thought the background was a lottery ticket, but thankfully the ''exam date'' at the top isnt too blurred and can still be read, although it was clearly not a ticket after that first initial glance. It''s a good image, meets the challenge.</td>', 'The DOF on this is really good, and the sharpness of the pencil is equally as good. At first I thought the background was a lottery ticket, but thankfully the ''exam date'' at the top isnt too blurred and can still be read, although it was clearly not a ticket after that first initial glance. It''s a good image, meets the challenge.', '2003-09-01 21:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(406695, 35906, 7778, '<td valign="top">A credible straightforward shot with a very ''real'' feel to it, technically aedequate. <br/> <br/>I admit that the wall is not without interest, but question the need to iclude as much of it as has been done. I feel similarly about the central composition, given the restful, uneven posture and casual attire of the subject. I can imagine a more charged  and less static image, if the rule of third had been considered for this picture.<br/> <br/>I like the choice of b &amp; w. It''s less likely to be viewed as a snapshot and, instead, seasons the picture. <br/> <br/></td>', 'A credible straightforward shot with a very ''real'' feel to it, technically aedequate.  I admit that the wall is not without interest, but question the need to iclude as much of it as has been done. I feel similarly about the central composition, given the restful, uneven posture and casual attire of the subject. I can imagine a more charged  and less static image, if the rule of third had been considered for this picture. I like the choice of b & w. It''s less likely to be viewed as a snapshot and, instead, seasons the picture.  ', '2003-09-01 22:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(406701, 35690, 7778, '<td valign="top">Wonderful typecast for this role (well ;-) except for the pale blue beauty with necklace who''s icecream is probably melting close-by)! I like broken-up group photography vs. a centrally composed background, the props and  vivid colours vs. the pastels of the wall, the lines of which approach thirds. The most frontal face (shades) seems to draw an upward light, as from a reflection on the ground (?), adding her own character.<br/> <br/>I do wish the shot were a tad sharper.  <br/> <br/></td>', 'Wonderful typecast for this role (well ;-) except for the pale blue beauty with necklace who''s icecream is probably melting close-by)! I like broken-up group photography vs. a centrally composed background, the props and  vivid colours vs. the pastels of the wall, the lines of which approach thirds. The most frontal face (shades) seems to draw an upward light, as from a reflection on the ground (?), adding her own character. I do wish the shot were a tad sharper.   ', '2003-09-01 22:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(406704, 35890, 7242, '<td valign="top">What little dolls! Beautifully lit, beautifully composed.  It''s an adorable shot. 10</td>', 'What little dolls! Beautifully lit, beautifully composed.  It''s an adorable shot. 10', '2003-09-01 22:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(406708, 35656, 7242, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. Great lighting and clarity. Darling model.</td>', 'Nicely done. Great lighting and clarity. Darling model.', '2003-09-01 22:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(406713, 35929, 5351, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites in a very competitive challenge!  I think this is technically excellent - great composition, lighting, tone, color, focus and border selection.  I hope someday I can take a shot like this.  I really like the way the colors complement each other but somehow remain subtle.  Great job - very high score:)</td>', 'One of my favorites in a very competitive challenge!  I think this is technically excellent - great composition, lighting, tone, color, focus and border selection.  I hope someday I can take a shot like this.  I really like the way the colors complement each other but somehow remain subtle.  Great job - very high score:)', '2003-09-01 23:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(406718, 35750, 5351, '<td valign="top">Great shot - the only thing I could suggest to improve it would be to have removed the green object in front of the dock (if possible).  It''s a bit distracting from what I think otherwise is a perfect shot with a great subject, background and colors. Good job!</td>', 'Great shot - the only thing I could suggest to improve it would be to have removed the green object in front of the dock (if possible).  It''s a bit distracting from what I think otherwise is a perfect shot with a great subject, background and colors. Good job!', '2003-09-01 23:07:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(406720, 35861, 5351, '<td valign="top">Great shot - I love the tone of this one.  The design in the cobblestone guides your eye right up to the bicycles.  Excellent composition and focus - high score:)</td>', 'Great shot - I love the tone of this one.  The design in the cobblestone guides your eye right up to the bicycles.  Excellent composition and focus - high score:)', '2003-09-01 23:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(406721, 35658, 5351, '<td valign="top">This is just too cool!  I will definately have to show my husband this one - he will love it.  But... back to the challenge - great original shot - colorful, fun, and the subject is absolutely adorable.  Good job - very high score:)</td>', 'This is just too cool!  I will definately have to show my husband this one - he will love it.  But... back to the challenge - great original shot - colorful, fun, and the subject is absolutely adorable.  Good job - very high score:)', '2003-09-01 23:09:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(406739, 35890, 9387, '<td valign="top">The clarity and the color on this picture is unbelieveable!</td>', 'The clarity and the color on this picture is unbelieveable!', '2003-09-02 00:06:47.000000', NULL, 1),
