(406997, 35814, 5112, '<td valign="top">SPARCO pencils, cool!  Good idea!  I like the white background and the delicate border.  Very nice.  ~9</td>', 'SPARCO pencils, cool!  Good idea!  I like the white background and the delicate border.  Very nice.  ~9', '2003-09-02 11:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(406998, 35902, 5112, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  What beautiful children.  I love the red bows in the girl''s hair.  The colours in this picture are very beautiful.  ~9</td>', 'Very nice!  What beautiful children.  I love the red bows in the girl''s hair.  The colours in this picture are very beautiful.  ~9', '2003-09-02 11:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(406999, 35809, 5112, '<td valign="top">Nice!  Love the background (the Persian shades - I don''t know what they''re called really, but I mean the white slates).  Colours are beautiful.  I like the little toy dog next to the shoe, makes it so much more real.  ~9</td>', 'Nice!  Love the background (the Persian shades - I don''t know what they''re called really, but I mean the white slates).  Colours are beautiful.  I like the little toy dog next to the shoe, makes it so much more real.  ~9', '2003-09-02 11:25:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(407000, 35750, 5112, '<td valign="top">Colours are beautiful, composition is very nice.  ~9</td>', 'Colours are beautiful, composition is very nice.  ~9', '2003-09-02 11:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(407001, 35810, 5112, '<td valign="top">Good title!  Nice picture - where is this?  The ironwork at the top of the building to the right looks a lot like the ironwork and iron fences on/by the Parliament Buildings in Ottawa, the fleur de lis (sp?) shapes.  I like the stormy clouds, they go well with the whole picture.  ~9</td>', 'Good title!  Nice picture - where is this?  The ironwork at the top of the building to the right looks a lot like the ironwork and iron fences on/by the Parliament Buildings in Ottawa, the fleur de lis (sp?) shapes.  I like the stormy clouds, they go well with the whole picture.  ~9', '2003-09-02 11:28:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(407003, 35869, 5112, '<td valign="top">Nice!  I like the hair peeking out, and the hand, he (I hope it''s a "he") certainly looks like he''s saying, "I''m still on vacation, leave me alone!"  Good entry.  I like the colourization; the border is just right for the picture.  Good work!  ~9</td>', 'Nice!  I like the hair peeking out, and the hand, he (I hope it''s a "he") certainly looks like he''s saying, "I''m still on vacation, leave me alone!"  Good entry.  I like the colourization; the border is just right for the picture.  Good work!  ~9', '2003-09-02 11:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(407004, 35928, 5112, '<td valign="top">Bored already?  Or maybe still tired from vacation?  Neat idea.</td>', 'Bored already?  Or maybe still tired from vacation?  Neat idea.', '2003-09-02 11:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(407036, 35861, 5391, '<td valign="top">Great leading lines, unusual, interesting composition.  Fantastic photography.  10</td>', 'Great leading lines, unusual, interesting composition.  Fantastic photography.  10', '2003-09-02 12:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(407084, 35758, 5475, '<td valign="top">How many times did you have to empty the sharpener??  This also would have been a nice shot for repetition.  You did a great job with your lighting, I can''t see any shadows to speak of...  Good luck...<br/>JD Anderson</td>', 'How many times did you have to empty the sharpener??  This also would have been a nice shot for repetition.  You did a great job with your lighting, I can''t see any shadows to speak of...  Good luck...JD Anderson', '2003-09-02 13:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(407087, 35865, 7857, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot indeed, we dont have shool buses like this over here so this is definately an unusual view for me. The perspective is great and its almost as if they parked this way just for your shot :o) Colours are nice and vibrant and the focus is spot on IMO. Great job, hope to see it place.</td>', 'Very nice shot indeed, we dont have shool buses like this over here so this is definately an unusual view for me. The perspective is great and its almost as if they parked this way just for your shot :o) Colours are nice and vibrant and the focus is spot on IMO. Great job, hope to see it place.', '2003-09-02 13:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(407093, 35928, 7857, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, it get across the total exasperation at having to be back at school after holidays. Nicely done, good luck.</td>', 'Nice shot, it get across the total exasperation at having to be back at school after holidays. Nicely done, good luck.', '2003-09-02 13:24:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(407095, 35571, 5475, '<td valign="top">A very cute portrait!  I like the use of BW here, and the composition is excellent.  I like your low view point...  Many people just shoot from their own height, which takes away from a child portrait, IMO.  You did a great jog of getting at his level, and the portrait reflects ''his world'' rather than him from an adult''s perspective.  A subtle change in technique that drastically changes the quality of a child''s portrait!  I don''t know how difficult it would be to do in this setting, but a little more light on his eyes would give this some WOW factor.  I love the look of concentration on his face, and I like the motion blur of his hand.  As a result of getting the hand motion, you also got a little blur in his hair...    very difficult to control, especially with small children as your subject (I have three boys 1, 3, and 5 years old).  Nice shot and good luck in the challenge!<br/>JD</td>', 'A very cute portrait!  I like the use of BW here, and the composition is excellent.  I like your low view point...  Many people just shoot from their own height, which takes away from a child portrait, IMO.  You did a great jog of getting at his level, and the portrait reflects ''his world'' rather than him from an adult''s perspective.  A subtle change in technique that drastically changes the quality of a child''s portrait!  I don''t know how difficult it would be to do in this setting, but a little more light on his eyes would give this some WOW factor.  I love the look of concentration on his face, and I like the motion blur of his hand.  As a result of getting the hand motion, you also got a little blur in his hair...    very difficult to control, especially with small children as your subject (I have three boys 1, 3, and 5 years old).  Nice shot and good luck in the challenge!JD', '2003-09-02 13:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(407097, 35890, 5475, '<td valign="top">This has the feeling of ''snapshot'', but the emotion portrayed on the girls'' face makes up for it.  I find the fence a little distracting...  In the future, it may help to ''plan'' your background, as much as you plan the subject matter!<br/>Nice shot and good luck in the challenge...<br/>JD</td>', 'This has the feeling of ''snapshot'', but the emotion portrayed on the girls'' face makes up for it.  I find the fence a little distracting...  In the future, it may help to ''plan'' your background, as much as you plan the subject matter!Nice shot and good luck in the challenge...JD', '2003-09-02 13:26:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(407099, 35571, 8522, '<td valign="top">My favourite shot this challenge. Great use of motion blur. Nice range of tones, looks great in b&amp;w. I like his expression. Effective cropping and composition. I would have prefered a shutter speed just a tad faster though, so the face would be sharper while leaving the hand blurred.  8</td>', 'My favourite shot this challenge. Great use of motion blur. Nice range of tones, looks great in b&w. I like his expression. Effective cropping and composition. I would have prefered a shutter speed just a tad faster though, so the face would be sharper while leaving the hand blurred.  8', '2003-09-02 13:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(407100, 35756, 7857, '<td valign="top">Nice candid shot, where is this? Nice positioning, good colour and generally a nice shot. Good luck.</td>', 'Nice candid shot, where is this? Nice positioning, good colour and generally a nice shot. Good luck.', '2003-09-02 13:28:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(407101, 35788, 8522, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, the selective desat works well here. To me, the desaturation says that the playground is grey and without colour because the children have gone, while the red and blue are like traces of the children still left in memory. Shame about the burnt out sky though, and the composition doesn''t quite do it for me. 7</td>', 'Nice idea, the selective desat works well here. To me, the desaturation says that the playground is grey and without colour because the children have gone, while the red and blue are like traces of the children still left in memory. Shame about the burnt out sky though, and the composition doesn''t quite do it for me. 7', '2003-09-02 13:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(407102, 35906, 8522, '<td valign="top">Interesting portrait, the foot in the foreground is a nice touch. Interesting background, but could perhaps do with more contrast with subject. Composition a bit too centred for my taste. 7</td>', 'Interesting portrait, the foot in the foreground is a nice touch. Interesting background, but could perhaps do with more contrast with subject. Composition a bit too centred for my taste. 7', '2003-09-02 13:31:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(407107, 35756, 8522, '<td valign="top">Almost brilliant, I really like this shot, which pulls you in to try to find out what is going on. Great colours in the background, but the composition is just a bit cluttered. The exposure is just a bit too dark for me. Your subjects have great expressions, chemistry and attitude. 7</td>', 'Almost brilliant, I really like this shot, which pulls you in to try to find out what is going on. Great colours in the background, but the composition is just a bit cluttered. The exposure is just a bit too dark for me. Your subjects have great expressions, chemistry and attitude. 7', '2003-09-02 13:33:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(407108, 35922, 8522, '<td valign="top">Very amusing, shame about the glare though. NeatImage could have removed some of the noise.  7</td>', 'Very amusing, shame about the glare though. NeatImage could have removed some of the noise.  7', '2003-09-02 13:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(407110, 35878, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great portrait, works nicely here in b&amp;w. You''ve captured some good expressions. Lighting works well. Effective feeling of spontaneity. 7</td>', 'Great portrait, works nicely here in b&w. You''ve captured some good expressions. Lighting works well. Effective feeling of spontaneity. 7', '2003-09-02 13:36:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(407111, 35743, 8522, '<td valign="top">Nicley lit, sharp, good composition, meets challenge. Missing the ''wow'' factor for me though. 7</td>', 'Nicley lit, sharp, good composition, meets challenge. Missing the ''wow'' factor for me though. 7', '2003-09-02 13:37:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(407112, 35750, 8522, '<td valign="top">Not really meeting the spirit of the challenge. Great picture though. 4</td>', 'Not really meeting the spirit of the challenge. Great picture though. 4', '2003-09-02 13:38:23.000000', NULL, 1),
