(407171, 35603, 11155, '<td valign="top">Well, I''m not too keen with seeing a gun in a "back to school" challenge, but I''m guessing that you''re reflecting back to a "Criminal Justice" class or school.  Even so, with the backpack there, it looks like a negative statement (gun in bag, take to school).  Good luck.</td>', 'Well, I''m not too keen with seeing a gun in a "back to school" challenge, but I''m guessing that you''re reflecting back to a "Criminal Justice" class or school.  Even so, with the backpack there, it looks like a negative statement (gun in bag, take to school).  Good luck.', '2003-09-02 15:06:25.000000', NULL, 1),
