(407529, 35865, 3554, '<td valign="top">Good shot for the challenge. Nice and clean with no distracting elements.</td>', 'Good shot for the challenge. Nice and clean with no distracting elements.', '2003-09-02 23:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(407549, 35777, 3724, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites.....  depicts an overlooked point of view, and beautifully done with b&amp;w.   The image is carefully composed, and the reflection of the face in the window is thoughtfully included.</td>', 'One of my favorites.....  depicts an overlooked point of view, and beautifully done with b&w.   The image is carefully composed, and the reflection of the face in the window is thoughtfully included.', '2003-09-02 23:20:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(407558, 35805, 10084, '<td valign="top">Really good colors. Nice and bright. Composition is very good. Dark backgrounds works. I would''ve prefer lunchables. lol :)</td>', 'Really good colors. Nice and bright. Composition is very good. Dark backgrounds works. I would''ve prefer lunchables. lol :)', '2003-09-02 23:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(407559, 35929, 10084, '<td valign="top">Great composition. The apple on is a bit dark . If you were able to desaturate everything but the red of the apple , the piece would be more powerful. The framing works with this photo.</td>', 'Great composition. The apple on is a bit dark . If you were able to desaturate everything but the red of the apple , the piece would be more powerful. The framing works with this photo.', '2003-09-02 23:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(407560, 35788, 10084, '<td valign="top">Great composition. Love the red in the swing and slide. It gives great emphasize to the play equipment. Very nice. It would make for a good postcard.</td>', 'Great composition. Love the red in the swing and slide. It gives great emphasize to the play equipment. Very nice. It would make for a good postcard.', '2003-09-02 23:33:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(407571, 35777, 2170, '<td valign="top">i wish any of my teachers had had a butt like that.  :)</td>', 'i wish any of my teachers had had a butt like that.  :)', '2003-09-02 23:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(407572, 35916, 7467, '<td valign="top">Love the texture of the wood</td>', 'Love the texture of the wood', '2003-09-02 23:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(407579, 35929, 4967, '<td valign="top">I like what you were going for here, a nice simple still life.  I think it could have been done a little more effectively though.  I do not like the way the books pages are turned towards us because you can''t see any deatail in them, this causes just a white corner.  The strobe you used seems a little harsh on the apple, and I don''t care for the way the light dies off on half the apple... just some suggestions.</td>', 'I like what you were going for here, a nice simple still life.  I think it could have been done a little more effectively though.  I do not like the way the books pages are turned towards us because you can''t see any deatail in them, this causes just a white corner.  The strobe you used seems a little harsh on the apple, and I don''t care for the way the light dies off on half the apple... just some suggestions.', '2003-09-03 00:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(407582, 35788, 4967, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot... very effective way to make a seemingly boring photo more interesting... nice composition as well.  -9-</td>', 'I like this a lot... very effective way to make a seemingly boring photo more interesting... nice composition as well.  -9-', '2003-09-03 00:13:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(407584, 35756, 4967, '<td valign="top">I hope you gave him a dollar for taking the picture... gees how desperate!  This is a very interesting photo... a lot going on here.  It bothers me that the girl next to the guy trying to get money has a cigarette which probably cost money... This photo says a lot to me, but not back to school.</td>', 'I hope you gave him a dollar for taking the picture... gees how desperate!  This is a very interesting photo... a lot going on here.  It bothers me that the girl next to the guy trying to get money has a cigarette which probably cost money... This photo says a lot to me, but not back to school.', '2003-09-03 00:16:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(407587, 35809, 4967, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo... I like it... good job getting the lighting just right, even with that window to the side.  I usually don''t like cheerleaders (some are good, most are snobby) but I like this photo enough to give it a -10-  Good luck!</td>', 'Very nice photo... I like it... good job getting the lighting just right, even with that window to the side.  I usually don''t like cheerleaders (some are good, most are snobby) but I like this photo enough to give it a -10-  Good luck!', '2003-09-03 00:18:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(407598, 35878, 10084, '<td valign="top">Wow this shot is incredible. Composition is really good. Subjects are interesting. The tutor and the yawning girl. The light behind the girl is a tiny bit distracting, otherwise is is an awesome shot.</td>', 'Wow this shot is incredible. Composition is really good. Subjects are interesting. The tutor and the yawning girl. The light behind the girl is a tiny bit distracting, otherwise is is an awesome shot.', '2003-09-03 00:36:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(407601, 35571, 10084, '<td valign="top">Interesting focus. Seems to be on the sweater. Not focusing in on the face,  is a good idea. When little kids draw, they move their head at the same time and you were able to capture this with the motion of the drawing hand. Great composition.</td>', 'Interesting focus. Seems to be on the sweater. Not focusing in on the face,  is a good idea. When little kids draw, they move their head at the same time and you were able to capture this with the motion of the drawing hand. Great composition.', '2003-09-03 00:41:08.000000', NULL, 1),
