(408842, 35858, 1078, '<td valign="top">OK, yeah, there are some problems with this -- but I like it. It certainly doesn''t deserve to be this far down in the heap.<br/> <br/>I think the biggest single thing that could have made it stronger would be a cleaner background.  If that was a nice solid black, with the funky erasers on top (I like the harsh color transitions), it would have looked more intentional and less accidental.  (Not saying the look was accidental, just that was how it was perceived.)</td>', 'OK, yeah, there are some problems with this -- but I like it. It certainly doesn''t deserve to be this far down in the heap. I think the biggest single thing that could have made it stronger would be a cleaner background.  If that was a nice solid black, with the funky erasers on top (I like the harsh color transitions), it would have looked more intentional and less accidental.  (Not saying the look was accidental, just that was how it was perceived.)', '2003-09-03 18:04:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(408858, 35865, 9550, '<td valign="top">You beat me by .0031 !!!!!! Congradulations!!! I drive a Blue Bird for the Army sometimes. I dont know why the company name is Blue Bird when the Buses are yellow???? I really like your composition in this one. Its a really crisp and clear photo. You would think that they would have to go do a special school to learn how to park the buses so perfect (LOL)(Great Angle)  Again, Great Job!!!!  The Weaz<br/> <br/>P.S. You know my pain comming in 4th!!!!! Your inside looking out #4 place... You deserve this one!!!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-09-03 17:37:45.</i></td>', 'You beat me by .0031 !!!!!! Congradulations!!! I drive a Blue Bird for the Army sometimes. I dont know why the company name is Blue Bird when the Buses are yellow???? I really like your composition in this one. Its a really crisp and clear photo. You would think that they would have to go do a special school to learn how to park the buses so perfect (LOL)(Great Angle)  Again, Great Job!!!!  The Weaz P.S. You know my pain comming in 4th!!!!! Your inside looking out #4 place... You deserve this one!!!', '2003-09-03 18:35:30.000000', '2003-09-03 18:37:45.000000', 0),
