(413828, 35730, 7560, '<td valign="top">*sigh* Darned return key...<br/> <br/>Anyway- Hello from Critique Club. <br/> <br/>First off, nice staged shot. It''s got a great laugh factor and reminded me vividly of the joys of back to school. I also personally like the fact it was the kids idea. <br/> <br/>Technically- <br/>I think the key to improving this shot rests in getting closer. I think getting physically closes as well as zooming in more would give this shot more impact. The expressions on the kids faces would add depth. You also have too much open space around the image.  A tighter crop on both the righ and left would give you a stronger image. <br/> <br/>Nice work and keep shooting!<br/> <br/>Clara</td>', '*sigh* Darned return key... Anyway- Hello from Critique Club.  First off, nice staged shot. It''s got a great laugh factor and reminded me vividly of the joys of back to school. I also personally like the fact it was the kids idea.  Technically- I think the key to improving this shot rests in getting closer. I think getting physically closes as well as zooming in more would give this shot more impact. The expressions on the kids faces would add depth. You also have too much open space around the image.  A tighter crop on both the righ and left would give you a stronger image.  Nice work and keep shooting! Clara', '2003-09-09 23:07:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(415176, 35949, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very, very nice!  I like your choice of timing to take this, just after sunset, right?  Nice deep blues.</td>', 'Very, very nice!  I like your choice of timing to take this, just after sunset, right?  Nice deep blues.', '2003-09-10 20:30:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(416346, 35949, 6870, '<td valign="top">Right, Rob. I ran up there at about sunset, but suddenly all of my kids wanted to come too, so I got there a little late, so it was just after sunset. I hardly altered this shot at all; I did rotate it about 1 degree CW (apparently not enough!), and still had about 30 seconds to get it up before the challenge deadline!<br/> <br/>This, by the way, is Utah State University--we''re the Aggies, too, in addition to Texas A&amp;M.</td>', 'Right, Rob. I ran up there at about sunset, but suddenly all of my kids wanted to come too, so I got there a little late, so it was just after sunset. I hardly altered this shot at all; I did rotate it about 1 degree CW (apparently not enough!), and still had about 30 seconds to get it up before the challenge deadline! This, by the way, is Utah State University--we''re the Aggies, too, in addition to Texas A&M.', '2003-09-12 00:42:21.000000', NULL, 0),
